                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "defad89a-6342-32be-87db-318f35f49a1e",
                                        "entry_id": "200c6f3b-026b-3aa7-9719-8e2cb4d1a3f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a pale, yellowish beige colour, like that of a dried straw."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd67ba94-5e2d-3612-b775-5af2692fbb10",
                                        "entry_id": "200c6f3b-026b-3aa7-9719-8e2cb4d1a3f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Imaginary, but presented as real."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4550136-707f-4e0b-8943-2f56cc9e6038",
                                                "sense_id": "dd67ba94-5e2d-3612-b775-5af2692fbb10",
                                                "text": "A straw enemy built up in the media to seem like a real threat, which then collapses like a balloon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "straw",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28947dd6-0a30-3bfe-9113-9f3e91f4f51b",
                                        "entry_id": "274b21f1-c660-38ff-9912-768e6940e00b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To lay straw around plants to protect them from frost."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a360de2f-cc90-369f-8d28-1cdd301bba5f",
                                        "entry_id": "274b21f1-c660-38ff-9912-768e6940e00b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To sell straws on the streets in order to cover the giving to the purchaser of things usually banned, such as pornography."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5db5b858-bcb4-4000-b462-cd387a6fc109",
                                                "sense_id": "a360de2f-cc90-369f-8d28-1cdd301bba5f",
                                                "text": "It was the custom for the disaffected of those days to make known their grievances by distributing papers on doors of public buildings, and even strawing them in the high way, for the benefit of the chance passenger."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e167686-2910-4754-afba-a86a6b3103e3",
                                                "sense_id": "a360de2f-cc90-369f-8d28-1cdd301bba5f",
                                                "text": "I have already alluded to \"strawing,\" which can hardly be described as quackery. It is rather a piece of mountebankery. […] The strawer offers to sell any passer by in the streets a straw and give the purchaser a paper which he dares not sell. Accordingly as he judges of the character of his audience, so he intimates that the paper is political, libellous, irreligious, or indecent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f574e593-2af1-4c72-88ba-d7c0afcd7853",
                                                "sense_id": "a360de2f-cc90-369f-8d28-1cdd301bba5f",
                                                "text": "Forasmoche as there be diverse lewd and sedicious [folks] personnes [being so given to sedicon as they care not f] whiche do labor nowe to mayntain the traitorous doings of the duke of Somerset, and for that purposed do ivise the most vile false and traitorous bills, papers, and boks that ever were harde off, strawing the same in the stretes, aswel within the Citie of London [and] as in diverse [other] townes and other places in the cuntrey; wherein they do falsly and traitorously travail to slaunder the kings mat Counsail, thinking therby to amase and abuse his Mat good subgietts, which be in a redynes to joyne with the said counsail for the delyverey of the king our soveraign Lords most Royal person, remayning to his great peril and damage in the said dukes custody, and for the restoring of this noble Realme to some better order and quietnes, whiche shalbe the benefite [of every man] of us all universally;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08209075-282e-4655-a7ca-cee5af8aad2b",
                                                "sense_id": "a360de2f-cc90-369f-8d28-1cdd301bba5f",
                                                "text": "Townspeople who saw 'strawing' and 'following the wran' as invasions by 'lusty young men of the country' saw Volunteer events in the same way."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
